# Robot dog — always

- This repo is in **planning (Phase 0)** unless `docs/build-phases/` says otherwise.
- Read `AGENTS.md`, `docs/architecture/README.md`, and `docs/decisions/` before proposing parts or code.
- Canonical parts list is `bom/bom.csv`. Never add a part only in prose.
- Compute is fixed: Pi 5 8 GB + AI HAT+ 26 TOPS. Motion: v1 is 12× MG995 + PCA9685; ST3215/STS3215 deferred (ADR-0002).
- If architecture changes, add or update an ADR in the same change.
- Do not invent walking firmware, CAD, or a second HAT stacked on the AI HAT+.
